\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces System architecture. The BatchScheduler on the head node groups tasks by model and applies Johnson's Rule ordering. The StorageManager triggers asynchronous checkpoint prefetching to worker nodes. Workers run vLLM with sllm-store for pinned memory management.\relax }}{14}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:system_arch}{{4.1}{14}{System architecture. The BatchScheduler on the head node groups tasks by model and applies Johnson's Rule ordering. The StorageManager triggers asynchronous checkpoint prefetching to worker nodes. Workers run vLLM with sllm-store for pinned memory management.\relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
